          <h1 class="headings">Vision/Mission</h1>
          <div align="justify">
            <div class="department-hod-all">
  <h1 class="department-heading">Vision :</h1>
  <p>
    To be a globally recognized university imparting quality, skill-based education and serving as a hub of research and innovation that creates world-class professionals to serve the nation and humanity at large.
  </p>
  <img class="img-left" alt="VSSUT" src="images/visionnmission.jpg" />
</div>
<div class="department-hod-all">
  <h1 class="department-heading">Mission :</h1>
  <ul class="sambalpuri-bullet">
    <li><strong>M1. Education beyond Classroom Learning:</strong>
    <p>To impart quality education in Engineering, Science, Humanities, and Management to produce professionals with strong practical skills and ethical grounding through participative and cross-cultural learning.</p>
    </li>
    <li><strong>M2. Socially Relevant and Useful Research:</strong>
    <p>To carry out creative, need-based, and impactful research addressing industrial challenges and community requirements through state-of-the-art facilities and strategic collaborations.</p>
    </li>
    <li><strong>M3. Entrepreneurial Ecosystem:</strong>
    <p>To promote the spirit of innovation and entrepreneurship in line with the vision of Make in India, Startup India, and Startup Odisha through an internal support system and partnerships with world-class industries, academia, R&D organizations, and alumni.</p>
    </li>
    <li><strong>M4. Societal Contribution with Nation First:</strong>
    <p>To impart education rooted in Indian ethos and empower students to contribute to Viksit Bharat 2047 through sustainable technologies and human-centric initiatives.</p>
    </li>
    <li><strong>M5. Holistic Human Development:</strong>
    <p>To nurture holistic professionals with the ability to solve complex problems, strong leadership qualities, high ethical and moral values, and a passion for lifelong learning.</p>
    </li>
  </ul>
</div>
